      "text": "{\"type\":\"final_answer\",\"content\":\"All done. Here's a summary:\\n\\n## ✅ Order Confirmed\\n\\n- **Order ID:** `ORD-8B2C1D3E` — status: confirmed\\n- **Item:** Sony WH-1000XM5 Headphones (Silver) — 2 units × $399.00 = **$798.00 subtotal**\\n- **Coupon applied:** `WELCOME10` (10% off) — saved **$79.80**, total charged **$718.20**\\n- **Payment method:** credit_card\\n\\n## 🎧 Product Selection\\n\\nI found 2 similar options to the black XM5 and chose the best one:\\n| Product | Price | Stock | Relevance |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Sony WH-1000XM5 **Silver** (`p_sony_xm5_slv`) | $399.00 | 10 | 3 ← selected |\\n| Apple AirPods Pro 2 | $249.00 | 50 | 1 |\\n\\nThe silver XM5 was selected because it had the highest relevance score (3) *and* sufficient stock (10) for quantity 2.\\n\\n## 💡 Coupons Checked\\n\\n1. **SAVE15** — $15.00 off orders over $100 (fixed)\\n2. **WELCOME10** — 10% off any order (percent)\\n\\nI evaluated both and selected **WELCOME10** as the better discount (10% vs. $15 fixed). Note: SAVE15 would have saved $15 less than WELCOME10 on this order, so it wasn't chosen.\\n\\n## ⚠️ One Note on Your Request\\nYou asked for the order of **2 silver** XM5s, which I completed. I also found out you wanted help with **p_sony_xm5_blk** — that was the reference product (black XM5) being compared against, not an item to order. The purchase above is for the **silver** alternative, which was selected as the best available stock-recommended option.\\n\\nIf you'd like, I can build a cart for the black XM5 (p_sony_xm5_blk) as a separate item",
